# DS4 ordered Spark inventory example (Spark0/Spark1)
#
# One target per line. Format matches the Mac-side ops helpers:
#   <user>@<host>
#
# Notes:
# - Order matters: first line => spark0, second => spark1.
# - Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored.
#
# Usage examples:
#   ./scripts/ops_spark_ring_mesh_check.sh --topology ring --inventory-file deploy/config/inventory.ds4.spark01.example
#   ./scripts/ops_stage_spark_ring.sh --mesh-check --topology ring --inventory-file deploy/config/inventory.ds4.spark01.example
#   ./scripts/ops_spark_ring_status.sh --preflight tp2 --strict --inventory-file deploy/config/inventory.ds4.spark01.example
#   ./scripts/ops_spark_ring_ops_check.sh --preflight tp2 --strict --journal --lines 120 --inventory-file deploy/config/inventory.ds4.spark01.example
spark0@<spark0-host>
spark1@<spark1-host>
